##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene Depth of field from Camera.md: three spheres, with the camera focused on the middle one
version 3.03
Hider "raytrace"
Format 320 240 1
Display "focus.png" "file" "rgb"
PixelSamples 6 6
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.1 100
# an f-stop of 0.7, a focal length of 0.5, and focus at 6 units, where the middle sphere stands
DepthOfField 0.7 0.5 6
Imager "background" "background" [0.55 0.65 0.8]
Rotate -12 1 0 0
Translate 0 -1.4 5.5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.2]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [0.9] "to" [0.5 -1 0.8]

AttributeBegin
Color [0.8 0.8 0.75]
Surface "matte"
Polygon "P" [-5 0 -5  5 0 -5  5 0 6  -5 0 6]
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
Color [0.85 0.2 0.15]
Surface "plastic" "Ks" [0.6] "roughness" [0.05]
Translate -1.3 0.5 2.5
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
Color [0.2 0.7 0.3]
Surface "plastic" "Ks" [0.6] "roughness" [0.05]
Translate 0 0.5 0.5
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
Color [0.2 0.4 0.85]
Surface "plastic" "Ks" [0.6] "roughness" [0.05]
Translate 1.3 0.5 -1.5
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
